Plants: Rust's lua_Debug is 16 bytes longer than lua.h's, so lua_getstack
writes the record's last field past the end of the C caller's lua_Debug,
which sits on the C stack. valgrind sees nothing: only AddressSanitizer
puts red zones around stack variables.
Parts: chost

